      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the detect_image_labels.py file, I need to use a concrete external provider for detecting labels or objects in a static image. I will use the Amazon Rekognition service, which is a part of AWS AI services, for this task. The code will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Rekognition client to detect labels in an image. </thinking>\n",
